<title>JAPAN: Japan end-Feb oil product stocks up 19% yr/yr - MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan end-Feb oil product stocks up 19% yr/yr - MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry on Tuesday issued the following data on oil product stockpiles held by refineries, distributors and importers as of end-February:</p>
<p>		(1,000kl)   (1,000 bbl) mth/mth% yr/yr%</p>
<p> Gasoline	2,167	 13,630    + 3.1    - 4.9</p>
<p> Naphtha	 1,861	 11,706    +15.3    +29.5</p>
<p> Jet Fuel	  687	  4,321    - 1.0    +19.5</p>
<p> Kerosene	2,548	 16,027    -25.7    +33.0</p>
<p> Gas Oil	 2,341	 14,725    - 3.0    +39.1</p>
<p> Fuel Oil A    1,734	 10,907    + 2.7    +23.3</p>
<p> Fuel Oil B	  5	     31    +25.0    +66.7</p>
<p> Fuel Oil C    2,244	 14,115    + 6.7    + 5.7</p>
<p> Total	  13,588	 85,469    - 3.3    +19.0</p>
<p>(Figures may not tally due to rounding off.)</p>
</text>
